diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 5772552..8144f41 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -11,6 +11,16 @@ python3 -m tasklite stats
 python3 -m tasklite.api          # API on http://127.0.0.1:8080
 ```
 
+Due dates (`YYYY-MM-DD`):
+
+```
+python3 -m tasklite add "pay rent" --due 2026-11-01
+python3 -m tasklite list --overdue     # open tasks past their due date
+```
+
+Over the API, `POST /tasks` accepts `"due"` (400 on a bad date), every task JSON has a
+`"due"` field (`null` if unset), and `GET /tasks?overdue=1` lists overdue tasks.
+
 Tasks are stored in `tasks.json` in the current directory (override with `TASKLITE_FILE`).
 
 Tests: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -t .`
